---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Creator Agreement - BodhicAI">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;">
        <h1 style="font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 36px); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">Creator Agreement</h1>
        <div style="color: var(--body); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 16px;">
            <p>Last updated: August 6, 2026</p>
            <p>This Creator Agreement ("Agreement") governs the relationship between you ("Creator") and BodhicAI ("Platform") when you publish, distribute, or sell AI Agent Skills, Prompt Templates, or any other digital content ("Content") through the BodhicAI marketplace.</p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">1. Eligibility</h3>
            <p>To become a Creator on BodhicAI, you must be at least 18 years of age and have a valid BodhicAI account. By publishing Content, you represent and warrant that you meet these requirements.</p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">2. Intellectual Property & Ownership</h3>
            <p>You retain full ownership of all Content you upload. By publishing Content on BodhicAI, you grant us a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to host, display, distribute, and promote your Content solely for the purpose of operating the marketplace. This license terminates when you remove your Content from the platform.</p>
            <p>You represent and warrant that:</p>
            <ul style="margin-left: var(--space-lg); margin-top: var(--space-sm);">
                <li>You are the original creator of the Content, or you have obtained all necessary rights and permissions to publish it.</li>
                <li>Your Content does not infringe upon any third-party intellectual property rights, including copyrights, trademarks, or trade secrets.</li>
                <li>Your Content does not contain code, prompts, or instructions copied from proprietary sources without authorization.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">3. Content Standards & Prohibited Content</h3>
            <p>All Content must comply with our <a href="/acceptable-use" style="color: var(--primary);">Acceptable Use Policy</a>. In particular, Content must not:</p>
            <ul style="margin-left: var(--space-lg); margin-top: var(--space-sm);">
                <li>Contain malware, viruses, or malicious code of any kind.</li>
                <li>Include prompt injection attacks or jailbreak techniques designed to bypass AI safety measures.</li>
                <li>Facilitate illegal activities, fraud, harassment, or any form of harm.</li>
                <li>Contain misleading descriptions or exaggerated claims about functionality.</li>
                <li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">4. Security Scanning</h3>
            <p>All uploaded Content is automatically scanned by our security engine before publication. Content that fails security checks will be rejected. BodhicAI reserves the right to remove any Content at any time if it is found to violate this Agreement or pose a risk to users.</p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">5. Revenue & Payments</h3>
            <p>Creators may set their own pricing for paid Content. BodhicAI facilitates payment processing through Razorpay. Revenue distribution is as follows:</p>
            <ul style="margin-left: var(--space-lg); margin-top: var(--space-sm);">
                <li>Creators receive the sale amount minus the platform commission and applicable payment gateway fees.</li>
                <li>Platform commission rates are displayed on the <a href="/pricing" style="color: var(--primary);">Pricing</a> page and may be updated with prior notice.</li>
                <li>Payouts are processed according to the schedule outlined in your Creator dashboard.</li>
                <li>You are solely responsible for reporting and paying any taxes applicable to your earnings.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">6. Refunds & Disputes</h3>
            <p>Buyers may request refunds in accordance with our <a href="/refund-policy" style="color: var(--primary);">Refund Policy</a>. In the event of a dispute, BodhicAI will act as a neutral mediator. Creators agree to cooperate with any dispute resolution process in good faith.</p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">7. Content Removal & Account Termination</h3>
            <p>BodhicAI reserves the right to remove Content or suspend/terminate Creator accounts for violations of this Agreement, our Terms of Service, or Acceptable Use Policy. Repeated violations may result in permanent account termination.</p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">8. Limitation of Liability</h3>
            <p>BodhicAI is a marketplace platform and does not endorse, guarantee, or assume liability for any Content published by Creators. Creators are solely responsible for the accuracy, legality, and functionality of their Content. BodhicAI shall not be liable for any damages arising from the use of Creator Content.</p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">9. Indemnification</h3>
            <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless BodhicAI, its officers, employees, and affiliates from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses (including legal fees) arising out of your Content or your breach of this Agreement.</p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">10. Modifications</h3>
            <p>BodhicAI reserves the right to modify this Agreement at any time. We will notify Creators of material changes via email or platform notification. Continued use of the platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Agreement.</p>

            <h3 style="color: var(--ink); margin-top: var(--space-xl);">11. Contact</h3>
            <p>For questions about this Agreement, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@bodhicai.tech" style="color: var(--primary);">support@bodhicai.tech</a>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
